# Ubuntu White Alteration History

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    C0[Creation depth 0] --> C1[Alteration depth 1]
    C1 --> C2[Alteration depth 2]
    C2 --> CN[Alteration depth N]
    C1 -. previous_id .-> C0
    C2 -. previous_id .-> C1
    CN -. previous_id .-> C2
```

Each physical Sense copy maintains its own append-oriented history. The history is provenance, not a ranking of a person or an authorization mechanism.

```mermaid
classDiagram
    class AlterationRecord {
      sequence
      id
      previous_id
      timestamp
      copy_id
      alteration_type
      actor_id
      authorization_id
      before_identity
      after_identity
      alteration_depth
      schema_version
    }
    AlterationRecord --> AlterationRecord : previous_id
```
